### 댓글 작성
POST https://panda-market-api.vercel.app/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 800,
  "content": "테스트 댓글입니다!",
  "nickname": "SJ"
}

### 댓글 목록 가져오기
GET https://panda-market-api.vercel.app/products/800/comments?limit=20
